{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35614","headline":"代孔明哭先主 · 李山甫","name":"代孔明哭先主","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔南阳顾草庐，便乘雷电捧乘舆。\n酌量诸夏须平取，期刻羣雄待遍锄。\n南面未能成帝业，西陵那忍送宫车。\n九疑山下频惆怅，曾许微臣水共鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}